line	<col=000080>A few steps east of Slayer master <col=800000>Mazchna</col> in <col=800000>Canifis</col> is a patch of <col=800000>nettles</col>. Wear your gloves and pick at least five: the nettle water can easily boil over, especially at low cooking levels.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Pray at the Ectofuntus 7 or more times and talk to the Ghost disciple to get enough ecto-tokens for the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Velorina inside Port Phasmatys in the house just east of the gates to begin the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Necrovarus back at the Ectofuntus.</str>
