line	<col=000080>Return to the <col=800000>old crone</col>.</col>
step	35	-	Quick guide step 35
line	<str>Pray at the Ectofuntus 7 or more times and talk to the Ghost disciple to get enough ecto-tokens for the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Velorina inside Port Phasmatys in the house just east of the gates to begin the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Necrovarus back at the Ectofuntus.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Velorina again.</str>
line	
line	<str>A few steps east of Slayer master Mazchna in Canifis is a patch of nettles. Wear your gloves and pick at least five: the nettle water can easily boil over, especially at low cooking levels.</str>
line	
line	<str>Combine the nettle with the bowl of water, and cook it over a fire (there is a dead tree just south-east of the slayer tower). Do not drink the tea.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north-west to the old crone's house by the water, just east of the Slayer Tower.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the old crone east next to the slayer tower with nettle tea in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Put the tea in the porcelain cup and add your bucket of milk to the tea, then talk to the old crone again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Repair the model ship by using the needle on it. This will use up the silk and a thread.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the wrecked ship on the coast north-west of the Ectofuntus and directly north of the farming allotment.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up a ladder to the ship deck. Then, climb another ladder to get to the ship quarterdeck.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wait for the wind speed to drop to low, and search the mast multiple times to find out what colour the three components of the flag are.</str>
line	
line	<str>Dye the model ship's flag the right colours, mixing dyes as needed (use the dye on the toy ship and select which part to dye).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head down one level to the ship deck, talk to the Old man.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the key on the closed chest inside the captain's quarters to receive the first map scrap.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down to the lowest level of the ship and get ready to fight. Search the chests until you are attacked by a giant lobster (level 32). Kill it, then search the chest it came out of to get the second map scrap.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb back up the ladder and proceed to the north-west side of deck where there is a gangplank you can walk out onto some rocks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump along the path of rocks. At the end, there will be another chest with the final map scrap. (Save some run energy as some rocks take 5% energy)</str>
line	
line	<str>Fit all the map pieces together to get a completed treasure map.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back inside Port Phasmatys again, and go south-east onto the docks. Take the small rowing boat to Dragontooth Island which is south-east at the docks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Once there, use the map to find the treasure starting at the statue (or use the image on the right to find it). Dig with your spade, and you will find the book of Haricanto.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Port Phasmatys.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ak-Haranu around the docks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Robin in the inn. He'll challenge you to a game of Rune-Draw. Beat him four times (in total, does not need to be consecutive) so he owes you 100 coins.</str>
line	
line	<str>He'll give you the signed oak bow to repay the debt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take it back to Ak-Haranu for the translation manual.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ask the ghost innkeeper if he has any jobs for you. He'll give you a bedsheet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use bucket of slime on the bedsheet to dye it (can be bought from trader crewmembers at the docks to the east) and Wear it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Gravingas, the ghost activist protesting just inside the town's gate. He'll ask you for 10 signatures.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ask ghost villagers around town for signatures with the bedsheet equipped. You can alternate between just two ghosts for all the signatures. If one asks you for ecto-tokens, you can ignore them and ask the other, or you can pay if you have tokens to spare.</str>
line	
line	<str>With all 10 signatures, show the petition to Necrovarus.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the key Necrovarus drops and head upstairs. Use the key on the door and enter the room. Take his robes from the coffin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the old crone.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head back to the ectofuntus and talk to Necrovarus. Once you've spoken to Necrovarus, you will be able to enter Port Phasmatys freely.</col>
